window.products.push({"id":218059,"name":"HOMVIO 7.5in Silicone Air Fryer Liners - 4Pcs Heat Resistant, Food Safe, Reusable Airfryer Liners Silicone Basket & Gloves - Non-Stick Silicone Pad fo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71D6MwBHLFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PERFECT FITS ALL 3.6QT-6.8QT & BIGGER AIR FRYERS: HOMIVO 7.5inches reusable air fryer liners are not only perfect for 3.6QT-6.8QT air fryers but also perfect for the bigger sizes airfryers. Our Round Silicone pot is also Adjustable for Square Shape Air Fryers. Compatible with Gourmia, Ninja, COSORI, Phillips, DIDO, Climatic, Pro Breeze, Tower, Instant Pot, Instant Vortex, GoWise, Nuwave, PowerXL, Ultron, etc. EASY to CLEAN & DISHWASHER SAFE: Our reusable air fryer liners silicone is easy to clean and totally dishwasher safe, avoiding the trouble of hand washing as well as helping you save your time & energy. No more greasy mess on the air fryer basket and preserves the integrity and beauty of your food. FOOD-GRADE SILICONE MATERIAL: These reusable air fryer liners are made of safe food-grade silicone material. It's non-stick, non-toxic, BPA free, heat resistant up to 464 ℉ (240℃), colorfast, odorless, reusable, eco-friendly, and saves money. Better than disposable parchment paper. DESIGN WITH PRACTICALITY: Our silicone liners for air fryer basket is made with several silicone liners to increase airflow and heat distribution, help enhance the cooking process, and make it simple to drain any remaining grease or oil for healthier cuisine. WIDE APPLICATIONS: HOMVIO silicone air fryer liner is a must-have air fryer accessories, suitable for air fryers, steamers, ovens, instant pots, microwaves, etc. This air fryer silicone basket is A PERFECT GIFT FOR YOUR FAMILY, FRIENDS, and COOKING LOVERS.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71D6MwBHLFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOMIVO","source_asin":"B0BF5QJRJ4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-218059","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BF5QJRJ4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BF5QJRJ4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":218060,"name":"40 Mini Cupcake Boxes | Mini Cupcake Container 12 Compartment – Clear Plastic Mini Cupcake Carrier | Mini Muffin Holders - Small Cupcake Clamshell | D","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81AnxDXiT4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"QUALITY Made of durable oriented polystyrene (OPS) with wide ribbing along the sides for added strength, this plastic protects your baked goods. It's resistant to water and oxygen, and does not transmit exterior odors to food products. Plus, this container's durability enables you to stack containers for compact presentation and transportation. CLASSIC CLEAR DESIGN Perfect for birthday parties, school functions, or office celebrations, this clear plastic hinged cupcake / muffin container can hold twelve 1 oz. cupcakes or mini muffins! Whether you choose a dozen of the same flavor, or mix-and-match popular choices, this container's crystal clear appearance allows you to showcase your baked goods with eye-catching displays. STURDY  PACKAGING The dome lid and individual bases contour around the baked good's shape, ensuring a secure fit. Each compartment is ribbed around the base to accommodate the rippled texture of baking cups. Four funnel-shaped stands support the lid and prevent any disturbances to your icing, cupcake picks or other decorations. SECURELY SEALED This container's hinged lid and two rectangular lock tabs ensure the container remains securely sealed, but also opens effortlessly. No need to transfer cupcakes or muffins to another container, this packaging is perfect to display at picnics, parties, and other events. Plus, this container's grid placement allows adequate room for party guests to select their own cupcake or muffin without accidentally sticking fingers in someone else's icing. DIMENSIONS Length 9 15/16 Inches – Width 7 5/16 Inches – Height 2 Inches","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81AnxDXiT4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOUZZKINGZ USA","source_asin":"B07SD2CNRD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-218060","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SD2CNRD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07SD2CNRD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
