window.products.push({"id":218068,"name":"Aime Eternal Framed Canvas Wall Artwork for the Living Room - Black and White, Teal Tree Modern Art Decor- Art for Bedroom Wall Decoration-Cuadros par","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51FvjAhOI8L._AC_SL1020_.jpg","description":"Tranquility and peace of sitting on a red bench under a turquoise teal blue tree on a summer day or a colorful country autumn afternoon! Walk into any room in your home or office energized into the vibrance of a nature wall art decor landscape. Save yourself a headache. We have stretched & wrapped the giclee canvas for you onto wood frames with easy to hang hooks. 5 piece multi panel picture painting set measuring 40x22 inch printed with bleed proof ink onto a decorated polyester canvas. 2 panels-8 x 14in, 2 panels-8 x 18in, 1 panel-8 x 22in. Bring your room to life with this modern glossy, water resistant art work for rooms such as your bathroom that get moist. Aesthetic beauty that is eye catching. A wider array of bright, vibrant colors. A regular printer uses 6-8 inks. A giclee printer uses 10-12 inks and hues. Giclee prints have higher resolution. The ink jet spray nozzles produce finer dots and smoother finish. Maintain the same vibrant colors. Giclee uses heavier substrates such as canvas that will never yellow. Hand down through the generations. Will last 100+ years without fading. A family tree heirloom to last through the ages. Dust repellant to keep it looking brand new. Bargain of a print or poster. 𝗤𝗨𝗔𝗟𝗜𝗧𝗬 of a majestic rustic wall art painting. White borders give the appearance of it floating on your walls. Wow your family & friends with a present for birthdays, weddings, Mother’s or Father’s Day, Christmas, or house warming parties. Choose gift wrap at checkout. 100% return or exchange guarantee for any reason.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51FvjAhOI8L._AC_SL1020_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aime Eternal","source_asin":"B0968WK934","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-218068","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0968WK934","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0968WK934","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
