window.products.push({"id":218218,"name":"Hapther Coffee Mug Warmer, Candle Warmer Plate with Intelligent Auto On/Off Gravity Sensing Mug Heater Smart Coffee Cup Warmer for Desk, Office, Home,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FTNOM-MAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Meet your new favorite coffee accessory: Coffee Mug Warmer. Place your favorite cup coffee, tea, or cocoa on the plate, and it'll keep it nice and hot for hours—so you can enjoy it at your leisure. It comes with a 55 inch power cord so you can use it just about anywhere. 👉Lightweight Design & Best Gift Choice Small and light design allows you to hold the warmer with one hand. It doesn't take up much space and is easy to carry. It's a wonderful gift for your friends and family on birthdays, Thanksgiving and Christmas etc. 👉12-Hour Auto Shut Off Feature The default setting is 8-hour auto shut off, don’t worry about forgetting to turn it off. The timer will keep your coffee warm for between 1 and 12 hours, just press the left button to set the holding time at will. 👉Two-level Temperature Setting Adjustable two-level temperature design to meet more warm needs. Simply press the right button to adjust the temperature to P1 or P2, then you can control the temperature of your coffee between 122℉/50℃ and 140℉/60℃. 👉Noise Free & Almost Zero Decibels Nosie free design lets you not worry about being disturbed by any noise. It's multifunctional and can be used as a candle warmer. Let the fragrance fill the room when you are resting. 👉Suitable for Most Cups With a flat glass surface design,You don’t need to worry that your cup is not suitable for our cup warmer, it fits most of the commonly used cups, such as stainless steel cup, mug, milk box, glass cup and etc. Product Specifications Voltage: AC,110-120V Power: 18 Watt Cord length: 55 inch Material: tempered glass panel Weight: 0.35 lb /160g Warming range: 122℉/50℃- 140℉/60℃ Color: Green Package dimensions: 5.1\" * 6.6\" * 0.9\" Warning： Takes some time to dissipate heat after heating.Please do nor touch it and keep it out of reach of","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FTNOM-MAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hapther","source_asin":"B09GVD41MR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-218218","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09GVD41MR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09GVD41MR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
