window.products.push({"id":218330,"name":"Cozee Bay Bamboo Ziplock Bag Organizer for Kitchen Drawer, Baggie organizer, Compatible with Gallon, Quart, Sandwich and Snack Variety Size Bags (4 Pi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nkrCV75xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔️100% Natural Solid Bamboo Wood- natural, green, and safe ✔️Get Drawer/Home Organized- this Ziplock bag storage organizer is specifically designed for an organized and sleek home. ✔️Thoughtful Design and Stylish- the bag organizer has fully optimized dimensions for each compartment; no sharp edges with safety features; color shades and styles make them fit into different spaces & lifestyles. ✔️Compatible with Most of the storage Bags – compatible with most of the Gallon, Quart (including slider bags if the length is not over 8” ), Sandwich, and Snack size. ✔️No Assembling Needed- receive it and use it. We handle the complex part. Use in a drawer or on countertop.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nkrCV75xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cozee Bay","source_asin":"B0B37WBK3Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-218330","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B37WBK3Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B37WBK3Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":218331,"name":"STRUCTURES STEELOCK Headboard-Footboard Super Duty Steel Wedge Lock Metal Bed Frame with Adjustable Height Glides - Functions as Bed Rails - LIFETIME ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ftBZC9ljL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Sturdy Support Support your mattress with the sturdiest bed frame design available. The unique wedgelock connectors become stronger as more weight is applied and can support virtually any practical weight. The center support bar is 2-1/2\" wide and made from double rail angle iron. Side rails with protective end caps and cross arms are both 1-1/2\" x 1-1/2\". Powder coated in a stylish black matte. Adjustable Height Glides The six adjustable height glides allow fine tuned height matching and stabilizing, for a customized fit with your headboard and footboard. Extra wide construction offset to fit virtually all headboards. Easy Assembly The bed frame assembles easily in seconds with absolutely no tools. Assembled frame has deeply recessed legs that provide extra toe room to prevent foot injury. Lifetime U.S. Warranty Frame features a lifetime U.S. manufacturer's warranty against defects and workmanship. Available in Cal King, King, Queen, Full, and Twin configurations. Extra Long Rails The side rails of this bed frame are longer than those on a standard bed frame. The STRUCTURES bed frame is designed to be used with a headboard and footboard. A longer frame makes it easier to make the bed when a headboard and footboard are attached. The extra length gives you more space at the top and bottom of the mattress to tuck sheets, blankets and comforters down and out of sight. If you do not plan to attach a headboard and footboard to the bed frame, we suggest you purchase a frame with standard length side rails, such as the STRUCTURES Universal Bed Frame: http://amzn.to/2aKmQVR","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ftBZC9ljL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MALOUF","source_asin":"B008PNHTPS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-218331","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008PNHTPS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008PNHTPS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":218332,"name":"Electric Infrared Quartz Heater Deluxe Wood Cabinet with LED Digital Screen, Remote Control and Timer, Tip-Over & Overheat Protection, Quiet Space Hea","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718TNt9q75L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Stylish Design & Wood Cabinet 】The infrared quartz heater is durable and nice looking with real wood frame. The fashionable appearance of elaborate design can be used as a beautiful decoration in a room. Even after long hours of work, the surfaces of the wooden cabinets remain cool to the touch, so you can safely have these around children. 【Quartz Infrared Heating】The space heater with an infrared heating element of 1500w will quickly warm your large room, penetrate deeply, and effectively keep the humidity in the room without drying out the air. 【Remote Control & Electro Lock】The remote allows you to easily adjust warmth and set the off time in bed within 12 hours, without having to touch the quartz heater. The electric lock can help avoid the heater from being accidentally engaged by children.When locked, the functions of the control panel and remote will be locked for indoor use. 【Quiet & Portable】Compared to other heaters with low noise, infrared heaters work more softly and less noticeably. You can’t even remember if it’s still on when infrared heater working, which can improve the quality of your sleep.The cabinets are designed to move easily without taking up too much space and to store better in the summer. 【Fully Assembled & Safe Protection】 All you have to do is take the infrared heater out of its box, plug it into a wall outlet, set the temperature and you will immediately enjoy a lot of warmth from the heater. Overheat protection can keep you and your family safe. Tip-over protection will automatically shut the heater off when the heater is not horizontal，this minimizes the risk of fire.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718TNt9q75L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LifePlus","source_asin":"B08BLK1NBC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-218332","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BLK1NBC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BLK1NBC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
