window.products.push({"id":218380,"name":"Butter Box Cheese Container Keeper With Cutting Net Food Storage Box Kitchen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41mXZyInjTL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Features: 1. Made of high quality material, transparent, bright, safe and healthy. 2. Smooth edge, exquisite workmanship, thick and durable in use. 3. Easy to cut, it only needs to be cut once and is easy to use. 4. The cutting net is fine workmanship, soft and burr-free. 5. A practical storage box for butter and cheese.  Specification: Condition: 100% Brand New Material: PVC Size: Approx. 17*10*7 cm / 6.7*3.9*2.8 in Weight: Approx. 200g / 7.1 oz  Package list: 1 * Butter Box  Note: 1. Please allow 0-1 inch error due to manual measurement. Thanks for your understanding. 2. Monitors are not calibrated same, item color displayed in photos may be showing slightly different from the real object. Please take the real one as standard.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41mXZyInjTL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fdit","source_asin":"B07NWMYW87","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-218380","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07NWMYW87","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07NWMYW87","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":218381,"name":"Artisan Fermenting Crock (5 Liter, Leaves)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811diNb2zIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This crock is the perfect balance of an attractive display piece and a functional glazed ceramic fermenting crock. Each piece is hand made by a local artisan in a small workshop in Poland. The hand applied glaze comes in cream color with a light brown overlay on the outside. The interior has a smooth glazed finish, while the exterior features handmade decorative designs on the surface. The exterior glaze is thinner with a matte finish. This is a Stone Creek Trading exclusive item, we promise you won't find it anywhere else.   This fermenting pot, like all of our fermenting pots, features a water seal that allows gases to escape while preventing any mold from forming. The 5L size comes with our patent pending 6.5\" Luna Glass Crock Weights. This crock features a leaf design on each side of the crock. The leaf is designed after a cucumber plant and is a green color.  Because these crocks are handmade in a small studio, minor differences between crocks are to be expected. However, we feel that these discrepancies are part of the unique beauty of these crocks. The ceramic artists hand draw and paint the designs on the side of the crocks, which means slight variations in shape and color are to be expected.  These crocks are the perfect display piece for when you want to show off your fermenting experiments. They will look right at home on your countertop while they get to work creating a wonderful, probiotic rich super food!  Luna Glass Crock Weights are protected by US Patents D812,426 and 10,034,483 B2.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811diNb2zIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Stone Creek Trading","source_asin":"B072M5DNR5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-218381","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B072M5DNR5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B072M5DNR5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
