window.products.push({"id":218385,"name":"Condar Steel Catalytic Combustor for Blaze King Arrow Country Flame Dutchwest Vermont Castings Wood Stoves CS-100","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":290.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81uJxPeoEhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"For the following wood stove models:Arrow Heatilator 2200B Blaze King KEJ 1100, KEJ 1300, King early, Princess Insert Country Flame E1-6, E-2, O-2, R-6, S-1, S-6, SBF-A, W1  Dutchwest Sequoia pre 1990 Derco Grizzly All modelsLily Industries All models Vermont Castings Sequoia pre 1990 Steel catalyst measures 7 inches in diameter X 2 inches thick. Chemically converts toxic chemicals from smoke into water vapor and heat. Generates more heat with less wood. Strategically placed in the smoke path inside a wood stove or insert, catalytic combustor causes smoke to burn as fuel. That means a wood stove can be burned slowly, transforming most energy stored in a log to the room as heat, instead of to the outside as air pollution. They also help prevent build-up of hazardous creosote in chimney and flue. Condar recommends replacing your wood stove thermometer each time the combustor is replaced.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81uJxPeoEhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SteelCat by Condar","source_asin":"B001RIC0WA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-218385","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001RIC0WA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001RIC0WA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
