window.products.push({"id":218403,"name":"AHOLTA DESIGN Parson Chair Covers - Premium Stretch Chair Covers for Dining Room 4 Pack Fabric Dining Chair Cover Set - Removable and Washable Dining ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LORkJQghS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Are you tired of looking at your old, stained, worn-out upholstered chairs? AHOLTA DESIGN dining room seat covers will beautify your dining room with a minimal investment of your time and resources. Our parsons chair slipcover set will hide the dark history of your old chairs and protect them from new assaults, including greasy stains, spillovers, tears, or scratches. Five reasons to choose our dining room chair covers: ✅Soft material with an elegant look: In addition to adding a brand new look to your chairs, you’ll enjoy the soft texture of these dining chair covers. Also, we offer a variety of colors and textures to fit your preferences and needs. ✅Premium-quality: These dining seat covers are made of high-grade, water-repellant, tear-resistant polyester. Also, our slipcovers for chairs are manufactured under strict quality controls at all production stages. These kitchen chair covers will resist oil and wine stains and catch spills and food residue so you can enjoy your meals with complete peace of mind. ✅Extra-stretchy: Elastic chair covers will easily and snugly fit most parsons and dining chairs. These wrinkle-free, non-slip covers for dining chair seats will both adorn your dining room and improve your sitting comfort. ✅Easy care: Each parsons chair slipcover is machine washable and doesn’t require ironing. Just toss it into the washing machine, tumble it dry, and put it back on the chair. ✅Versatility: Protective chair covers are perfect for families with small children and pets. Our universal chair covers can be used as banquet chair covers or dining chair slipcovers at home, hotels or restaurants, or any other venue. Order an AHOLTA DESIGN dining chair cover set of 6 now and enjoy classy, worry-free dining.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LORkJQghS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AHOLTA DESIGN","source_asin":"B095P9YGYY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-218403","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095P9YGYY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095P9YGYY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
