window.products.push({"id":218509,"name":"Plastic Serving Tray, Black Wood Pattern Party Platters, Disposable Premium Durable Plastic, 17\" x 9\" Rectangular Serving Tray, 5 Pack - Posh Setting","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61XoSQXoqnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Elegant plastic party bowls Posh Setting offers sophisticated Serving Trays that simplify your hosting duties. Heavyweight, impact-resistant and available in your choice of clear, black or white, they allow you to treat your guests to snacks, desserts, soups and sides stylishly and without putting your expensive dinnerware at risk for chips or breaks. Unlike paper trays that can only accommodate dry contents like candies, popcorn, cake and such, these plastic bowls can be used to serve hot and cold foods that include chili, stew, pudding and ice cream without soaking through or becoming unstable. Contemporary design meets convenience These Angled Salad and pasta bowls take a cue from your favorite takeout containers. We offer small bowls for appetizers or medium-size serving trays and large trays for presenting sides at a buffet table. Posh Setting Serving platters make all your dinner parties and special events run smoothly and look impeccable. With 5 per set, you never have to leave the fun to clean and re-supply trays.. Non-toxic and resilient Durable plastic is BPA- and phthalate-free for your peace of mind. Posh Setting Food Trays for parties are cost-effective and dishwasher-safe. Throw them away after your event for easy clean-up, or wash and reuse them for your next family get-together or special event. Their voguish style makes them perfect for birthdays, baby showers, New Year's Eve and more. For stylish, affordable and carefree partyware, add Posh Setting Buffet Serving Trays to your kitchen essentials today.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61XoSQXoqnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Posh Setting","source_asin":"B07F8BDG1C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-218509","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07F8BDG1C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07F8BDG1C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
