window.products.push({"id":218556,"name":"Swiss Vegetable Peelers - 3 Pack – Sharp Hardened and Blued Steel Blades with Ergonomic Non-Slip Handles - Red, Yellow, Green - by Bovado USA","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714exZ6NZyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SAVVY CONSTRUCTION Pick up a Bovado Peeler and it will quickly become a kitchen staple! This savvy appliance features Swiss-made hardened and blued steel blades to prevent rusting, an ergonomic non-slip handle, and a small side loop. It has everything you need to peel produce comfortably and efficiently. Our strong, precise blades slice through any peel or skin, whether thin and delicate like tomato skin or thick and tough like pumpkin. Curved in shape, our blades glide through outer coatings, removing the inedible layers only and leaving you with more produce with which to cook. Durable and long-lasting, these blades stay sharp even through repeated use without dulling. No more laborious sharpening! Our handles, made of plastic or stainless steel, are non-slip with an ergonomic grip so they are easy and comfortable to hold. Peel fruits and vegetables for hours at a time with ease! Our specially-designed rapid peelers feature wider handles and blades to peel produce more quickly with an easier grip. All our peelers feature a small loop on the side designed to remove imperfections from root vegetables, like potato eyes. PRODUCT FEATURES: Swiss Carbon Steel  Ergonomic Grip Non-slip Handle Small Side Loop Removes Potato Eyes Set of 3 Peelers Dishwasher Safe Easy to Clean Choice of 3 Sets: Wide Handle Rapid Peelers in Red, Blue & Green Classic Peelers in Red, Blue & Green Stainless Steel Variety Pack, with Classic, Serrated and Julienne Blades FUNCTION AND CONVENIENCE Besides for their practical function in helping you peel your produce, these peelers also make stylish kitchen accessories that complement nearly any decor. Choose from two color combinations, red / blue / green or stainless steel. These sets of three allow you to use on peeler for vegetables, one for fruits, and still have another to spare. Or, give away as a gift - it’s perfect for newlyweds or housewarming.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714exZ6NZyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BOVADO USA","source_asin":"B06XN68SKJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-218556","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XN68SKJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XN68SKJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
