window.products.push({"id":218608,"name":"Basicwise Stackable Juice and Water Beverage Dispensers with Stand, 2.8 Gallon, Clear (QI003267)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61au78ftjiL._AC_SL1307_.jpg","description":"Hosting a party? From sweet tea and freshly-squeezed lemonade to fruit punch and ice water, this Stackable Juice and Water Beverage Dispenser will allow you to effortlessly serve refreshments. Can be easily stacked to double the drink choices.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61au78ftjiL._AC_SL1307_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Basicwise","source_asin":"B075FW86ZJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-218608","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075FW86ZJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075FW86ZJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":218609,"name":"Myson Authentic Spanish Stainless Steel Paella 18-Inch Pan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/517FDEixypL._AC_.jpg","description":"This 18 inch solid stainless steel pan is the ideal product for cooking the perfect paella. This pan is made in Spain in old fashioned tradition and is a true paella pan – wide, round and shallow, and with splayed sides. It is exactly the type that has been used in Spain through the ages. Paella is cooked in a thin layer which is the reason that paella pans are large and shallow. You will notice the large cooking surface that dips slightly in the middle to facilitate pooling of oil during preliminary sauteing. Myson paella pans are ideally suited for paella, but you will find your way to limitless uses for other dishes. It’s great for grilling, fish fries, clam bakes, breakfast, and a variety of outdoor cooking. Myson paella pans are meant to be used over an open flame, either in the kitchen on a gas cook top or over an open fire outdoors. This pan’s copper construction gives you the highest level of cooking temperature control. Only copper offers ultra-fast heat up and instant cool-off when removed from the burner. The secret is high thermal conductivity – copper is ten times more thermally conductive than steel, and twice as thermally conductive as aluminum. Copper makes a brilliant presentation at serving time too. Brass plated handles add a touch of elegance. Unlike bare steel pans, tin lined pans do not require seasoning and will never rust. Inspired the Spanish way: Spain is a country of strong contrasts, of passion and spirit, and this is reflected in its food. Paella is a family affair, and in Spain making paella is an excuse for a party, a ceremony, or a debate. It is our mission at Myson to bring the culinary experience of the Iberian Peninsula to your home kitchen. Not only do we carry a variety of authentic Spanish cookware, but also a selection of hard-to-find ingredients such as saffron, bomba rice, Valencia rice, and smoked paprika. Check out our other products available right here on Amazon.com.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/517FDEixypL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Myson","source_asin":"B000V5Q0GW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-218609","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000V5Q0GW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000V5Q0GW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
