window.products.push({"id":218640,"name":"KASENTEX All Season Dow Alternative Quilted Comforter Set Reversible Ultra Soft Duvet Insert Machine Washable (Queen Set, White)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":56.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71546ZIsIZS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% Brushed Microfiber With Hydrophilic Fiberfill QUEEN SIZE COMFORTER SET: 3-Piece includes 88x90\" queen comforter and two 21x27\" matching pillow shams. The comforter and pillow shams are made of a soft, durable fabric and feature a contemporary bedding design. DOWN ALTERNATIVE FILL – Filled with down-alternative fiber, this comforter is exceptionally soft and luxurious and comes with the feature of long lasting comfort. Four-hole high hydrophilic fiber filling technology traps the air and locks-in the warmth. Special 3D hollow staple down alternative fiber provides firmness and durability. Induced with unique foam with ability to float in water makes the comforter extremely comfortable to get the most invigorating sleep. BOX STITCHED DESIGN – The elegant Box stitched design does not only looks decorative but also helps evenly distribute the fiberfill and prevents shifting for maximum durability and deluxe feel. MACHINE WASHABLE – This Comforter comes with hydrophilic fiberfill which makes it machine washable & easy to maintain. It's also moisture absorbent & retains the fluffiness of the comforter. *Machine Wash Cold, Do Not Bleach, Do Not Iron, Do Not Wring Dry; Tumble Dry Low. * Vacuum Sealed Package to freshly preserve and protect it from external elements dust, moisture; perfect for gifting and storage. Once opened, we suggest for a quick fluff to revive comforter's original loft. PERFECT HOLIDAY GIFT & KASENTEX SATISFACTION! – Great holiday gift for family & friends, beautifully packaged with thought and care by yours truly, Kasentex! Comforter Set comes with 100% Guaranteed Satisfaction. We take customers as our top priority and aims to deliver the best products in the market.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71546ZIsIZS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KASENTEX","source_asin":"B07XJQSD53","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-218640","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XJQSD53","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XJQSD53","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
