window.products.push({"id":218667,"name":"Reusable Food Storage Bags, 6 Pack Extra Thick Leakproof Degradable Freezer Fresh Bag, FDA Grade PEVA Sandwich & Snack Bags, Free Ziplock Lunch Bag fo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GOVY8NtTL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"🎉【Biodegradable & Reusable Storage Bags, 100% Safe Food Grade PEVA Material】The reusable storage bags are made of food grade and eco-friendly PEVA material, PVC-free, lead-free, chloride-free and FDA-free, biodegradable and recyclable, environmentally friendly and non-polluting. This food storage bag can effectively extend the shelf life of food, healthy and 100% safe. You and your family can use it with confidence! 🍔【Upgraded Zipper & Wider Edge Sealing, Leak-proof & Waterproof】OCOOPA Updated lunch bag is easier to open/close than silicone bags, Mom no need to worry about their children can't open their lunch bags at school. We made improvements to the zipper and the edge to give it wider edges and added an anti-slip design for stronger sealing. This food storage bag can maintain the freshness of food, even can be use for liquid food! 🍩【Easy to Clean & Durable】These food storage bags are easy to clean, but not suitable for dishwashers, which can destroy zippers. You can leave the bag under the tap, wash it, let it dry. PEVA material is anti-freeze, but the maximum temperature it can withstand is 80℃/ 176℉. PEVA bags will not pollute the environment even if they are discarded. This reusable bag can replace up to 500 single-use bags. You are hero of protecting the environment! 🍓【Widely Used & Convenient Your Life】The reusable storage bag is 0.4mm thick and comes in two different sizes for snacks or other home storage. Let your child carry lunch without a heavy and space-hogging tray, or use these food bags to pack your weekend picnic food. You can also use them to pack your travel toiletries and spare items from your life. They are small and simple, but they can be widely used and can bring convenience to every aspect of your life! 🍬【Ideal Gift for Environmentalists】 If you're looking for a sturdy, reusable food storage bag, this one is the perfect choice! And it's also a great gift for everyone. Let's create a better future for our planet! 100% satisfaction guarantee - 30 days free return, 12 months free warranty. If you contact us, we guarantee that we will perfect for you to solve any dissatisfaction or quality problems!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GOVY8NtTL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OCOOPA","source_asin":"B07TQ8N2RT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-218667","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TQ8N2RT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TQ8N2RT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
