window.products.push({"id":218740,"name":"Eilong Special Gifts, 13 OZ Tea Mug with Large Infuser Basket & Insulated Lid, 304 Stainless Steel Tea Infuser with Metal Flower Totem, Tea Cup Set fo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.13,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jSUh19ApL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍂 TOP GRADE QUALITY – The infuser mug is made from top grade heat resistant borosilicate glass that could withstand instantaneous temperature differences between -4℉ to 300℉, making it safe for boiling water and microwave. The scratch resistant material and wide mouth user friendly design allows it to be easily cleaned both by hand and by dishwasher. 🍂 REMOVABLE INFUSER – The fine mesh infuser filter is made with high-grade 304' stainless steel with food-safe PVD that could filter ultra-fine tea leaf particles. This means you can use it to brew loose tea, herbal tea, or even coffee. The infuser's beautiful original filter patterns are designed to look like a miniature garden inside the mug. The infuser has a height of 3 inches and a diameter width of 1.93 inch, plenty of space for the brewing tea leaves to swirl around and float freely. 🍂 HEAT-INSULATED LID – The strainer lid’s innovative double wall design provides structural heat insulation, keeping it cool and safe to the touch when brewing tea or removing the lid. 🍂 CLEAR GLASS MUG – Allows you to visually track the progress of your tea steeping process so that you can tell when your tea will be ready. Perfect for brewing loose tea leaves, floral tea and tea bags, it is also great for serving other kinds of beverages such as coffee and beer. 🍂 SATISFACTION GUARANTEED – We at EILONG have a focus on the art of tea, teapots and tea accessories, we strive to be the tea brand of choice for tea enthusiasts worldwide, EILONG is dedicated to providing the best customer service and user experience possible. If at any point you are not satisfied with our products, please contact us directly so that we can provide you with the best solution for you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jSUh19ApL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Eilong","source_asin":"B09KCG4XRW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-218740","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KCG4XRW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KCG4XRW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":218741,"name":"Gadroad 3-Tier Shoe Rack,Black Metal Shoe Rack with Wooden Top Board,Modern Shoe Storage Organizer with 2 Metal Mesh Shelves,Each Tier Fits 3 Pairs of","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CQMGPtdxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Metal 【Sturdy & Durable Design】Gadroad Shoe Rack Made of thickened metal tubes, 3-tier metal wire shelves, E1-Grade MDF top board, and the foot plastic pad ensures that the shoe rack is stronger, which protects the tile and wooden floor from scratches. Compared with the woven shoe rack, it has better stability and load-bearing capacity, and it is more textured than the all-metal tube shoe rack. Our shoe rack can perfectly decorate any corner of your home, and it would be the best choice for you. 【Size & Function】23.2”W x 11.8”D x 16.9”H, and it offers you plenty of space for your family to put their shoes on. Each tier can hold up to 3-4 pairs of shoes, fits all kinds and sizes of shoes, boots, high heels and sneakers. The top board can be used to place your bags, keys, potted plants and decorations; Picture of your family is great too! Our shoe rack can easily organize messy shoes for your family, ideal storage solution for your hallway, entryway, closet, dormitory, garage. 【Shoe Rack Innovator】Combining simplicity and industrial aesthetics to create this simple and stylish modern furniture. Without taking up too much space or too much money, it can be used for decoration and storage. 【Easy to Assemble】All the accessories are marked with numbers, making it very easy to assemble with the instructions and tools included in the package. 【Gadroad Service & Guarantee】We stand by our products. If you have any problems, please do not hesitate to contact us via Amazon Buyer Message for help.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CQMGPtdxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gadroad","source_asin":"B0B5LH4NPH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-218741","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5LH4NPH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5LH4NPH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
