window.products.push({"id":218766,"name":"Merle Haggard Song List Incredible Mosaic Framed Print Limited Edition w/COA","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51-d+f3fKWL._AC_.jpg","description":"Framed, ready for display! Approximately 9 X 11 inches This is an art print image. It has a solid background color and is made entirely of Merle Haggard song titles. The song names make up the entire image. Even the very fine lines and what looks like shading are small words. The entire song is repeated several times throughout the piece. Super cool art piece that sells for $45+ in the art shop and auction houses. This is an cool framed print by pop artist Paul Van Scott. He has made rare and unusual art pieces using poker chips, golf balls, photos, political buttons, hockey pucks, M&M Candies and playing cards to name a few. He has designed and sold mosaics for over 10 years to celebrities, athletes and museums. He's created art for covers of well known magazines, music albums and company logos. Pauls work has been featured on the Fox hit TV show \"GLEE\", college textbooks and in many news articles by outlets such as Coast To Coast AM, TMZ, The Rod Serling Foundation, Grand Illusions, Cover Magazine, Thrillist magazine and more. His \"Hank Williams Jr. bottle caps mosaic can be seen in the 2013 Matt Damon film \"Promised Land\". Very nice, limited edition piece. This is for the true collector. This listing is for a limited edition framed print directly from the artist. It is on the highest quality non-fade professional photo paper. We guarantee this to be high quality and authentic. The uniqueness of this item cannot be understood truly until you see it in person. Please view it from extremely close-up then at least 10-15 away to get the complete effect. Amazingly the farther you move it away the more detail you see. Paul has created this himself. It will NEVER be mass produced. VERY limited edition!! No more than 500 signed prints per size will EVER be released directly by the artist! You will receive a framed print along with a numbered C.O.A. that has been hand-signed by the artist.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51-d+f3fKWL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Final Score Products","source_asin":"B01E4A7SO2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-218766","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01E4A7SO2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01E4A7SO2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
