window.products.push({"id":218784,"name":"Youpinle 5 Pairs Fiberglass Chopsticks-Reusable Chopsticks Dishwasher Safe-Color flower, 3*10 (Y-010)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.39,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DGTu6ZUKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A Brand You Can Trust - YOUPINLE 1. Our chopsticks are made of premium fiberglass material,they are healthy and reliable. 2. Our fiberglass chopsticks can withstand the high temperature of 356℉, so they can be safely cleaned in the dishwasher without worrying about melting, bending, or cracking. Note: When using the dishwasher to clean chopsticks, it’s necessary to add a dishwasher basket to prevent it from sliding and causing damage. 3. If you love to eat noodles, pasta, Japanese ramen, sushi, hot pot, Korean cuisine, Chinese cuisine, or any Asian cuisine, our chopsticks will be very suitable. These chopsticks are designed for non-slip making it easy for you to enjoy delicious food, ideal for household and restaurant use, or travel portable use. Chopsticks are suitable for extensive use on various occasions. Youpinle Fiberglass Chopsticks Instructions ：1. Soak the chopsticks in warm water for about 5 minutes before using and then wipe them dry with a clean cloth. Use it with confidence.2. There are dust particles when the chopsticks are opened? Because our chopsticks are packed in OPP plastic bags and cartons, the plastic bags will generate static electricity and adsorb particles. It's a normal phenomenon. It's recommended to soak with water or clean it before use. 3. Fiberglass chopsticks are suitable for cooking at low or medium oil temperature (below 356 degrees Fahrenheit). They are not suitable for high oil temperature cooking(365°F~485°F). I believe you will fall in love with them .","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DGTu6ZUKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YOUPINLE","source_asin":"B09PDHYD19","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-218784","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PDHYD19","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PDHYD19","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
