window.products.push({"id":218831,"name":"Humidifier for Bedroom, 400ml Small Humidifier with 7 Colors Night Light, Portable Mini Air Humidifier for Bedroom, Car, Quiet, Office, Travel, Auto S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51uYZxbUtGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍃​Portable Mini Humidifier- This small and lightweight humidifier is the ultimate solution to combat dry air on the go. Weighing just 0.386lb and measuring 6.7x2.4in, it's easy to carry around whether you are at home, at the office or on the go. Despite its small size, this mini humidifier delivers a powerful mist output to keep you comfortable and hydrated. Its user-friendly design makes it effortless to set up and start using right away. Do not let the dry air cramp your style - take this little wonder with you wherever you go! 🍃Vibrant Sleep Lights & Whisper-Quiet Operation- Experience the ultimate in comfort and style with this mini humidifier. Its vibrant sleep lights come in seven different colors, providing a delightful and customizable ambiance that will soothe your senses and enhance your sleep quality. And with its whisper-quiet operation, you can enjoy the benefits of moistened air without any distracting noises. This humidifier is the perfect addition to any bedroom or office, delivering both functional and aesthetic value to your space. 🍃USB-Powered & Water-Free Auto Shut-Off- The Gorbiller mini humidifier boasts two handy features that make it a great addition to any space. First, it's powered by USB, which means you can plug it into your laptop, power bank, or any USB port for easy and hassle-free use. Second, it has a water-free auto-off feature, which ensures safety and energy savings by automatically shutting off when the water level is too low. That way, you can enjoy the benefits of moistened air without worrying about overheating or wasting electricity. 🍃Adjustable Levels of Mist- This small humidifier offers two spray modes to suit your needs and run time preferences. You can choose a gentle mist or powerful spray with easy-to-use controls. The humidifier has an interval mode running up to 8 hours and a continuous mode running up to 4 hours. It's effortless to switch between modes and achieve your ideal humidity level. Select the mode that fits your needs and desired runtime with this versatile and user-friendly humidifier. 🍃Premium Material & Thoughtful Present - Meticulously constructed with the finest quality materials for exceptional durability and performance. This warm and thoughtful gift is not only practical but also visually appealing, making it the perfect addition to any living or working space. With sleek and stylish design and intuitive controls, our humidifiers are effortless to operate and maintain. Say goodbye to the discomfort of dry air and embrace a healthier, more pleasant atmosphere with our premium humidifier.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51uYZxbUtGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gorbiller","source_asin":"B0BQHT3VHD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-218831","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQHT3VHD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQHT3VHD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
