window.products.push({"id":218845,"name":"Pauwer Farmhouse Laundry Room Rug Runner 2'x6' Non Slip Kitchen Floor Mat Laundry Rugs and Mats Decor Washable Runner Rug Entryway Rug Runner for Laun","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81o9rdsQtyS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Laundry Room Rug Runner Size: The long laundry mat for laundry room measures 2' x 6' ( 60 x180 cm), featuring a low-profile design which make the entryway rug not easy to be curled and kicked up, long enough to cover both the washer and dryer area, keep your floors away from stains and dust, wear resistant. Durable Laundry Rug Runner: The farmhouse runner rug for laundry room is made of quality nylon with printed laundry pattern surface, non-shedding. The laundry room rug is delicate and non-balling, can scrape dirt, dust, sand and absorb moisture from your shoes as well. Moreover, the premium material also makes the kitchen floor mat long-lasting and durable, you do not need to replace it frequently. Non-Slip Laubdry Area Rug Runner : Come with non-Skid TPR rubber backing, which is more slip-resistance than other cotton backings, PVC backings and polyester backings, makes the laundry rug stay in place, give you the safest protection, make you walk on it when doing laundry instead of slippy. Easy to Clean: The laundry room mat will not take you a long time to clean this laundry rug runner, just wipe & vacuum regularly. For a quick clean, just simply shake, vaccum cleaning or machine washable. If the kitchen rug runner is really dirty, please brush with soapy water. Laundry Mat Wide Applications: Laundry room rugs available black and purple color, matching different home decor, perfect solution for wash room floor mat, laundry room rug in front of washer and dryer, kitchen rug runner, indoor entrance doormats, hallway runner rug, bathroom rug, both beautiful, vintage and functional. WARM NOTE: The Laundry Room Rug Runner is folded packaging, may have some crease, you can put heavy things on the crease, walk on it for several days or iron it to flatten.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81o9rdsQtyS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pauwer","source_asin":"B0BMTMF167","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-218845","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BMTMF167","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BMTMF167","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
