window.products.push({"id":218867,"name":"Casademont Double-Walled Beer Glass (13 ounce / 370 ml), Set of 4 Premium Unique Double Insulated Beer Glass | Double Wall Clear Pint Inverted Beer Gl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DjD5c1CmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Beer should be enjoyed cold, with its faint golden sparkle sheen inviting you to sip it while you are outdoors under the hot summer sun. But this picturesque scene is shattered more often than not by tepid temperatures and melted ice cubes diluting your beer and reducing it into sour and watery vinegar. We, from Casademont abhors the way beers are reduced into 2nd rate beverages that’s why we designed a Freezable Beer Glass that’s made of a double vacuum walled Borosilicate glass that has been heat tempered and gradually annealed, making it keep heat transfer to a minimum, allowing your beer to stay cold for long and enabling the double-wall mug to be freezable without risk of breaking. If your beer is an essential part of your rest and relaxation, then the Casademont Double Wall Mug is the only double wall beer cup that you need. KEEP YOUR BEVERAGE COLD FOR LONG Our Double Wall Beer Glasses Set are thermodynamically designed to only have one point of heat exchange surface in the lip. This Double Wall Beer Mug Glass design prevents heat from escaping or entering your drink while it is on our Beer Glass For Men and Women, keeping it cold for as long as you want. No more rushing to drink your beer so that it wouldn’t turn tepid or watery as the ice melts. FIRST CLASS BOROSILICATE GLASS- ANNEALED AND TEMPERED The Casademont brand double-walled beer glass uses a borosilicate type of glass for double protection. It has been heat tempered and slowly annealed, giving it superior strength than other inverted lip beer glasses. This means that it won't easily break under extreme temperature changes. SHATTER RESISTANT- PURCHASE WITH CONFIDENCE We stand with the Casademont Beer Glass Bulk Set’s quality and decadent design. Encountered issues with our Double-walled Beer Glasses? We got you covered, no questions asked!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DjD5c1CmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Casademont","source_asin":"B0B39JSL7M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-218867","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B39JSL7M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B39JSL7M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
