window.products.push({"id":218943,"name":"Joyloce to My Mom Blanket Gift from Daughter Son 60x50 Inches | I Love You Mom Inspirational Letter Printed on Throw Blankets | Gifts for Her Birthday","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810nt+m5iqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Wrap Your Mom with A Letter of Love】: To my mom, I will always be your little girl and you will always be my loving mother. Thank you for the sacrifices you make every day. I love you with all my heart to the world, you may be just a mother but to me, you are the world. Love, your daughter. 【The Most Comfortable Blanket】: It boasts a flannel fleece & Sherpa, measuring 60x50 inches(152*127cm). The blanket is very soft and durable to feel like a warm hug, It has the characteristics of non-pilling, non-wrinkle, and non-shedding. 【Custom blanket】:This soft throw blanket from daughter to mom is specially designed for expressing love between relatives. The purpose of this throw blanket is not only to bring warmth but also to bring love. A gift from daughter to mom way for the giver to express love, make her feels warm and loving. Imagine the moment your mom opens the pack and realizes this is a perfect gift for her! 【Send Thoughts of Love and Care】: This original sherpa throw blanket for mom is a good gift to celebrate your mom for her birthday, Mother’s Day, Anniversary, Christmas, Thanksgiving, or just a simple I Love You My Mother and I Appreciate You gift for any time of the year. It would also make the best mom gift for a milestone birthday like a 30th, 40th, 50th, 60th, 70th, 80th, or any birthday in between. 【A Gift for Many Occasions】You can use this fluffy blanket when reading, watching movies at home. Also, it can be used as an outdoor blanket when camping because it's lightweight and portable. Ideal for airplane, camping, sofa, bed, outdoors and car. This love blanket is a perfect gift for mom.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810nt+m5iqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Joyloce","source_asin":"B095JNGBSF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-218943","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095JNGBSF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095JNGBSF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
