window.products.push({"id":218949,"name":"MASJENBU Strainers and Colanders Bowl Set, Sturdy Kitchen Sink Strainer for Fruit and Vegetable Wash, Noodle Pasta Strainer, BPA Free, Dishwasher Safe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VuuZDIdPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【High Quality and Heat Resistant】- Our strainers and colanders with mixing bowl uses PP5, a food-grade healthy plastic that is BPA-free, toxic-free, odor-free, sturdy and durable.The colanders & food strainers are very resistant to high temperatures and suitable as a pasta strainer. The health of you and your family is our primary concern. 【Ideal practical Kitchen Helper】- Excellent strainer for kitchen, you can use it to drain pasta, noodles, berries, potatoes, mixed salad, rinse beans, quinoa, beef, canned foods, etc. versatile kitchen strainer for straining, soaking, washing, and storing. the colanders & food strainers basket and strainer bowl can be used together or separately. It will make your cooking efficient and enjoyable. 【2 Packs total 4 Pieces】- Include 2 bowls，2 colanders. The 5.5 quart bowl size is 11.4\" x 9.8\", 4.5\"deep and its colander size is 11.08\" x 9.48\", 3.71\"deep. The 2.5 quart bowl size is 7.8\"x7.8\",4\"deep and its colander size is 7.48\"x 7.48\", 3.21\"deep. Together With many snowflake filtering holes in the bottom, this vegetable and fruit washing basket can dry efficiently and completely. You can nest them together and keep them in the cupboard to save space. 【Modern Design and Save Water】 - The cute strainers and colanders will add color and vitality to your home with their fashionable and comfortable appearance.The frictional handles of the small strainer can help you easily lift the inner colander with the food out of the outer bowl water, and you can reuse the water for the garden flowers. 【Dishwasher Safe and Easy Clean】- Our colanders & food strainers can easily put in the dishwasher，and easy hand clean. Pls note microwave use is not suggested.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VuuZDIdPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MASJENBU","source_asin":"B0BPWQXX8K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-218949","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BPWQXX8K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BPWQXX8K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
