window.products.push({"id":218993,"name":"SUPERIOR Cotton Percale Deep Pocket Sheet Set, Queen, Burgundy, 4-Pieces","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":43.92,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6131w1WquBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Affordable Luxury Linens Drape your bed in these durable and extra soft percale woven sheets from Superior. Crafted from premium, 100% Cotton with a cozy 300-thread count, these sheets feature a closely-woven percale where each yarn is woven over and under the next to create a lovely, smooth fabric that's both resilient and soothing to the skin. Percale has a crisp, soft, lightweight feel that makes it ideal for year-round use and works well during warm, summer months. These breathable sheets are cool to the touch, and get softer with every wash.   Each set includes 1 flat sheet, 1 fitted sheet, and 2 pillowcases. The fully-elasticized fitted sheet boasts a deep pocket construction that is designed to fit oversized mattresses up to 18” thick. This gorgeous set is available in an array of solid colors with a matte finish that will transform your bedroom into a serene retreat.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6131w1WquBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SUPERIOR","source_asin":"B00TASPIY6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-218993","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00TASPIY6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00TASPIY6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":218994,"name":"rongflower Artificial Flowers Combo Box Set Champagne Pink Fake Flower Leaves Box with Stems for DIY Wedding Bouquets Centerpieces Arrangements Bridal","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819-0Mh933L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Innovative Style】 Each box comes with a variety of flowers and greens and comes with wire stems, these flowers and greens are perfect for you to create your bouquet, table flowers, centerpieces, wreath decorations or any other floral arrangement for any special occasion. 【Package include】—Foam Rose: Champagne X3，Pink X2，Milk white X3，—Silk roses:Orange Austen Rose X1，Dark Pink Flannel Rose X1，Light orange rose X1，Champagne Rose X1，Small Roses X4(assorted size)，Champagne Peony X3，Tea Bag Flowers X2，Hydrangea X4，Includes Eucalyptus / Willow Leaves, 6 different plant leaf accessories. There are plenty of flexible plant stems for DIY. 【Premium Material】The whole set is made of two kinds of materials: made of high quality silk and foam, which makes them look more distinctive. 【Perfect Gift Choice】 These artificial flowers come with a box, each of our flowers is carefully selected, it is perfect to be arranged at events/parties such as weddings and baby showers, as bouquets, centerpieces, kissing balls, boutonnieres, cake arrangements, etc. 【Note】These rose silk flowers are handmade, please understand that the size may vary slightly and there might be slightly color differences between different dye lots.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819-0Mh933L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"rongflower","source_asin":"B09W5L9T45","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-218994","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09W5L9T45","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09W5L9T45","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":218995,"name":"OYEL Christmas Cookie Cutters, 8PCS Christmas Cookie Cutter Stainless Steel Including Christmas Snowman,Tree,Reindeer,Sled Shapes,GIft Box Package Chr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712GnBCnkaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Merry Christmas! Are you still worried about how to make more creative cookies for Christmas? Do you make more interesting Christmas food for friends and neighbors? Are you still troubled by not finding a suitable mold?If you want to solve the above problems, then this cookie cutter set will help you solve these problems very well. Baking 3D Christmas trees, reindeer, sleigh and snowman cookies will bring a lot of fun to your Christmas! WHY CHOOSE US? 1. 430 food grade stainless steel, rust-proof and durable2. Easy to clean3. Easy to cut bread and demould4. 3D Christmas cookie slicer kit, also suitable for cutting bread, fudge, soft fruit, sandwich, cheese. ITEM SPECIFICATION Size：Color box 9.25*5.35*1.22 inches ，200gQuantity: 8 piecesMaterial: 430 food grade stainless steel  Application: Good for a pancake mold, or for cutting cookie dough, fondant, soft fruits, bread, sandwiches, cheese, cookie or craft clay. Package content Snowman * 2Christmas tree * 2Reindeer * 2Children's sleigh * 2Color box*1 STEPS: Step1.Roll out the cookie dough to 1/5inch thickness evenly on cookie baking pan.Step 2. Take out the cookie cutters, and press them into the dough.Step 3.Remove the extra dough that is outside of shapes, and the cookie cutters.Step 4. Place in oven, and bake for 15 minutes at 320 Fahrenheit.Step 5. Finally, create 3D cookie with joy.Apply some icing on the cookies (Option) ❤❤Warm Tips:❤❤ ❤Wash the cookie cutters with warm soapy water before use. ❤You need to flour them before you push them into the dough. It makes them slide out easier without damaging the shape. ❤Don't make the cookies too thick or they won't fit toge ther properly.❤Separate them from other cookie cutter set to make sure they won’t be bent or damaged.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712GnBCnkaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OYEL","source_asin":"B08DJ399F3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-218995","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08DJ399F3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08DJ399F3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
